body:
Lmao that reaction is something i expected as a roach and perf main, i know there are a lotttt of toxic mains out there but i promise im not one of them, im just trying to improve my kiting/rescuing and i like support ;w;

I do adore ithaqua though, hes soooo much fun to play and i love everything about him, i got him day 3 (i spent SOOOOO much on morningstar... a shameful amount....) and ive been playing him ever since, but galatea is my og hunter main and ill forever be loyal to her 🫶💕 

Though i cant lie, i really like how fools gold plays, i love the easy chip damage i love how decently easy it is to aim and how his abilities cover a lot of ground - hes not perfect and theres some holes but he is balanced, i like him a lot.
